# The previous EC2/ALB backend at https://3-213-104-77.nip.io is no longer a
# valid Socket.io target. Leave the general backend empty so production does
# not spam failed TLS socket attempts; live data surfaces use direct fallbacks.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=

# Cross-device OBS overlay relay (API Gateway WebSocket -> Lambda -> DynamoDB).
# Deliberately UNSET: the old relay (pmjn3dol69.execute-api.us-east-1) was
# removed in the Aug 2026 AWS cleanup and the host no longer resolves, so
# setting it only produced a reconnect loop. Same-device overlay still works
# via BroadcastChannel/localStorage. Point this at a new relay once one exists
# (infra/overlay-relay has the Lambda).
# VITE_OVERLAY_WS_URL=
